      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARTLAND BONNIE (3) has been out of the placings at her last two outings but shapes well for this if she can recapture her flying win a few runs back, getting around this track over 390m in 22.07. Hard to top on best recent times. FINESSE (4) was out of the placings last time when sixth at Bendigo (25.03) but did record second best time of the card when winning five back. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Worth another chance. KRAKEN MILLY (7) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 4th (22.49) at this track. Should be in this for a long way. LADY HALIME (2) won by a wide margin last start. Big chance on that form.",
